{"page":88,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:60","surah":4,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ إِلَى ٱلَّذِينَ يَزْعُمُونَ أَنَّهُمْ ءَامَنُوا۟ بِمَآ أُنزِلَ إِلَيْكَ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ مِن قَبْلِكَ يُرِيدُونَ أَن يَتَحَاكَمُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱلطَّـٰغُوتِ وَقَدْ أُمِرُوٓا۟ أَن يَكْفُرُوا۟ بِهِۦ وَيُرِيدُ ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ أَن يُضِلَّهُمْ ضَلَـٰلًۢا بَعِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you [Prophet] not see those who claim to believe in what has been sent down to you, and in what was sent down before you, yet still want to turn to unjust tyrants for judgement, although they have been ordered to reject them? Satan wants to lead them far astray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"[towards]","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَزْعُمُونَ","en_gloss":"claim","transliteration":"yazʿumūna","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"(is) revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَبْلِكَ","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablika","verse_key":"4:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"They wish","tra